    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Who Receives Technical Violations?\"\nformat: html\n---\n\n\n**Who receives technical violations?**\n\n1. What proportion of youth on probation supervision receive a technical violation during a probation term? How does this vary across race/ethnicity, sex, and risk level? \n\n2. Descriptive overview of the population of youth who receive a technical violation during the study period (when technical violation was the primary offense) by race/ethnicity, age category, sex, and risk level  \n\n3. What proportion of violations filed by a PO are rejected by supervisor or prosecutor?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n# 1. Technical Violations Overview\n\n**NOTE:** All analysis of technical violations in this section (e.g., supervision episodes with at least one technical violation) refers to the filing of any technical violations regardless of outcome/disposition. \n\n<br>\n\n## Table 1. By FY: Percentage of Supervision Episodes/Referrals with a Technical Violation\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<table class=\"table table-striped table-hover table-condensed table-responsive\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n <thead>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> FY of Completion </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Youth (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Referrals (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Supervision Episodes (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Supervision Episodes, Percent of Sample (%) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Supervision Episodes, with at least one technical violations (%) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Supervision Episodes, with at least one new offense violation (%) </th>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2018 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,866 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,900 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,910 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 24.0% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 18.4% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 3.4% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2019 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,830 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,863 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,869 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 23.5% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 17.9% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 4.5% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2020 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,641 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,673 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,677 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 21.1% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 21.9% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 5.1% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2021 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,025 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,041 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,042 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 13.1% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 16.0% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 5.0% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2022 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,148 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,166 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1,168 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 14.7% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 12.5% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2.4% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2023 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 296 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 297 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 297 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 3.7% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 13.5% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 0.7% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> Overall </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 7,013 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 7,802 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 7,963 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 100.0% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 17.7% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;font-weight: bold;\"> 4.0% </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n`````\n:::\n:::\n\n\n<br>\n\n## Table 2. By Race/Ethnicity: Percentage of Supervision Episodes/Referrals with a Technical Violation\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<table class=\"table table-striped table-hover table-condensed table-responsive\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n <thead>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Race/Ethnicity </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Youth (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Referrals (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Supervision Episodes (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Supervision Episodes, Percent of Sample (%) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Supervision Episodes, with at least one technical violations (%) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Supervision Episodes, with at least one new offense violation (%) </th>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> Asian </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 68 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 74 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 76 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1.0% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 7.9% </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 0.0% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> Black </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 3,073 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 3,457 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 